<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Charge Wand</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 15)
Mana: 60
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast charge wand &lt;wand&gt;
</pre>
<p>Restores spent charges to a magic wand you carry, up to as many as the 
wand can hold. The better your spell, the more charges come back: one 
for a modest success, up to four or more for a master.
</p><p>It is risky. If the spell fails, the wand only sputters and goes dim; but 
if it fails badly, the wand explodes in a sphere of uncontrolled mana, 
and is lost: a lightning bolt strikes everyone in the room, you included. 
Charge wands where no friend stands close. You must be standing, and no 
free hands are needed. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
